{"version":1,"content":"<p>西藏那曲市巴青縣今晚10時33分發生7.0級地震，震源深度10公里。</p><p>暫無人員傷亡和財產損失的報告。</p><p>這是內地自2024年1月新疆阿克蘇地區烏什7.1級地震後，時隔2年半再次發生7級強震。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:24.189946+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:55:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:18:19.576053+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:57:59.263099+00:00","content_hash":"ec59b65fd7a2c6d6be21f8f8a5c215d3121ae2d137650cee60d244510612af80","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}